  "description": "Unified, extensible database provider framework for relational databases.\n\t\t\tCurrent implementation supports PostgreSQL with planned extensions for SQL Server, MySQL, Oracle, and Snowflake.\n\t\t\tFeatures include query execution, stored procedure support (single/multiple cursors),\n\t\t\tretry policies, comprehensive error handling, and integrated logging. Cryptography package hav been updated for the security purposes.",
